#: loader.php:215 pro/loader.php:215
msgid "What does Permissions-Policy do?"
msgstr "What does Permissions-Policy do?"

#: loader.php:214 pro/loader.php:214
msgid "Controls iframe embedding. SAMEORIGIN allows only your domain to frame your pages. Prevents clickjacking attacks where malicious sites embed your site in hidden iframes."
