msgid "Your server sends the CSP with Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only instead of Content-Security-Policy. The browser checks the policy but blocks nothing — only reports violations. Perfect for testing."
msgstr "Your server sends the CSP with Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only instead of Content-Security-Policy. The browser checks the policy but blocks nothing — only reports violations. Perfect for testing."

